            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Research has begun, and the first local period calculation is saved.\n\nThe main finding is that, after subtracting the universal quadratic term, the first correction depends entirely on derivatives through order four and reproduces an existing BW-08 quantity. Its positivity also occurs in polynomial collision controls, so it does not establish simplicity.\n\n- [Research note](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-3/13_contradiction_analysis/04_boundary_winding/threshold_routes/13_spectral_covers_and_periods/notes/01_NODAL_PERIOD_VARIATION_AND_FOUR_JET_COMPARISON_20261021.md): derivation, complete remainder bounds, controls, and direct comparison.\n- [Updated progress register](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-3/13_contradiction_analysis/04_boundary_winding/threshold_routes/13_spectral_covers_and_periods/research-progress/01_SPECTRAL_COVERS_AND_PERIODS_PROGRESS_20261021.md): completed steps and next research decision.\n- [Chat archive](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-3/13_contradiction_analysis/04_boundary_winding/threshold_routes/13_spectral_covers_and_periods/chat-histories/README.md): registered, with final-response capture arranged.\n\nSeven exact polynomial checks and fourteen floating diagnostics passed. A self-review is saved; numerical theta evaluation and independent review remain outstanding."
            ]
